      "created_at": "2015-09-05T16:47:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I haven't had much time to play lately, so a few days ago I decided to boot up Sentinels on my ipad and play. No sound. No music. No nuthin'. Everything else in the game works. I have checked the Options and made sure both the sound sliders are all the way up. No other app or anything on the ipad&nbsp;has this problem. I'm stumped. Has anyone else had this happen?</p>",
