      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/919ad9/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-09-07T23:31:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Apparently, just above the volume buttons of an ipad, there is a tiny little switch. Flip that, and the only sounds you will hear are things like video files, or youtube, etc. I didn't notice it before, and assume my daughter tripped it at some point in the last few days. Color me doofus.</p>",
